\tag{status:frozen}

\p{A VDC∞ is not Reedy fibrant, not a fibration over \code{N(Δᵒᵖ)}, not a double ∞-category (no horizontal composites), not symmetric. Each of those is either a class inside the definition (fibrant), a comparison target (style A, → \ref{at-rt-0009} at \ref{ms-0006}+), or a derived structure when extra properties hold (composites, → \ref{dec-ft-0002}).}
